OL,3,GNEWSAFace coverings ban not ruled out
OL,4,Ain Stoke
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour leader of Stoke-on-Trent City
OL,7,FCouncil Jane Ashworth said she would
OL,8,Fconsider introducing a ban on face
OL,9,Fcoverings in the city.
OL,11,FThe measure would follow similiar
OL,12,Frestrictions put in place in Stafford,
OL,13,FWolverhampton and Nottingham, in an
OL,14,Feffort to clamp down on anti-social
OL,15,Fbehaviour in town centres.
OL,17,FLast month, the authority had to ban
OL,18,Funder-15s from travelling alone on
OL,19,Fbuses in the evenings for free because,
OL,20,Faccording to Ashworth, bus drivers were
OL,21,Fbeing 'harassed' by 'unpleasant and
OL,22,Fdangerous behaviour'.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
